"The Rite is the magic of Gorgon's people: intermediating between a person and their potential."
"It is triggered by drinking the supplicant's blood."
"It demands sacrifice for power: destroying the very resource one needs to enhance."
"The gift checks the supplicant's will and allows no Rite without an accord."
